<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Login Failed</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body, html {
      height: 100%;
      font-family: 'Fira Mono', monospace;
      color: #222;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 50px 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      max-width: 420px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 90px;
      color: #e74c3c;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #e74c3c;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 2px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.349);
      background: transparent;
      color: black;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: black;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .info {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #222;
      background: #e6e6e6;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">❌</div>
    <h1>Login Failed</h1>
    <p>We couldn’t log you in. Please check your email, and try again.</p>
    <a href="<%= fontend_url %>/signin" class="btn">Sign in Again</a>

    <div class="info">
      ⚠️ <strong>Note:</strong> Your login token expires in <strong>20 minutes</strong>.<br>
      Do not share this link or token with anyone for security reasons.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
